+# 能力契约规范
+
+> 版本：v1.0.0
+> 日期：2026-09-19
+> 状态：正式版
+> 适用范围：薯片生态能力体系的契约权威：能力模型、命名规则、注册/发现/注销、JSON Schema 约定、权限映射、Bridge 内置能力逐项契约、内容处理服务能力登记、第三方能力注册规则、生命周期与版本、错误码。
+
+---
+
+### 7.4 窗口 `window:*`
+
+| 能力 ID | 输入要点 | 输出要点 |
+|---|---|---|
+| `window:create` | `title`；`width` / `height`；`resizable` 默认 `true`；`entry`：包内相对路径，缺省使用 `ui.surface` 入口 | `{ windowId }` |
+| `window:list` | 无输入 | `{ windows }`：调用方可访问的窗口摘要数组（`windowId` / `title` / `state` / `focused`） |
+| `window:focus` | `windowId` | 无输出；自身窗口免权限判定 |
+| `window:close` | `windowId` | 无输出；关闭前由应用处理未保存状态 |
+| `window:resize` | `windowId`；`width` / `height` | 无输出；用户可手动改变大小时同样生效 |
+| `window:move` | `windowId`；`x` / `y`：屏幕坐标（像素） | 无输出 |
+| `window:setTitle` | `windowId`；`title` | 无输出 |
+| `window:setState` | `windowId`；`state`：`normal` / `minimized` / `maximized` / `fullscreen` | 无输出 |
+
+```typescript
+interface IWindowCreateInput {
+  title: string;
+  width: number;
+  height: number;
+  resizable?: boolean;
+  entry?: string;
+}
+
+interface IWindowCreateOutput {
+
+  windowId: number;
+}
+
+type WindowDisplayState = 'normal' | 'minimized' | 'maximized' | 'fullscreen';
+
+interface IWindowInfo {
+  windowId: number;
+  title: string;
+  state: WindowDisplayState;
+  focused: boolean;
+}
+
+interface IWindowListOutput {
+  windows: IWindowInfo[];
+}
+
+interface IWindowFocusInput {
+  windowId: number;
+}
+
+interface IWindowCloseInput {
+  windowId: number;
+}
+
+interface IWindowResizeInput {
+  windowId: number;
+  width: number;
+  height: number;
+}
+
+interface IWindowMoveInput {
+  windowId: number;
+  x: number;
+  y: number;
+}
+
+interface IWindowSetTitleInput {
+  windowId: number;
+  title: string;
+}
+
+interface IWindowSetStateInput {
+  windowId: number;
+  state: WindowDisplayState;
+}
+```
+
+```typescript
+const windowInputSchemas: Readonly<Record<string, JSONSchema>> = {
+  'window:create': {
+    type: 'object',
+    additionalProperties: false,
+    required: ['title', 'width', 'height'],
+    properties: {
+      title: { type: 'string', minLength: 1, maxLength: 128 },
+      width: { type: 'integer', minimum: 320, maximum: 8192 },
+      height: { type: 'integer', minimum: 240, maximum: 8192 },
+      resizable: { type: 'boolean', default: true },
+      entry: { type: 'string', pattern: '^[A-Za-z0-9._-]+(/[A-Za-z0-9._-]+)*$' },
+    },
+  },
+  'window:focus': {
+    type: 'object',
+    additionalProperties: false,
+    required: ['windowId'],
+    properties: {
+      windowId: { type: 'integer', minimum: 1 },
+    },
+  },
+  'window:close': {
+    type: 'object',
+    additionalProperties: false,
+    required: ['windowId'],
+    properties: {
+      windowId: { type: 'integer', minimum: 1 },
+    },
+  },
+  'window:setState': {
+
+    type: 'object',
+    additionalProperties: false,
+    required: ['windowId', 'state'],
+    properties: {
+      windowId: { type: 'integer', minimum: 1 },
+      state: { type: 'string', enum: ['normal', 'minimized', 'maximized', 'fullscreen'] },
+    },
+  },
+  'window:list': {
+    type: 'object',
+    additionalProperties: false,
+    properties: {},
+  },
+  'window:resize': {
+    type: 'object',
+    additionalProperties: false,
+    required: ['windowId', 'width', 'height'],
+    properties: {
+      windowId: { type: 'integer', minimum: 1 },
+      width: { type: 'integer', minimum: 320, maximum: 8192 },
+      height: { type: 'integer', minimum: 240, maximum: 8192 },
+    },
+  },
+  'window:move': {
+    type: 'object',
+    additionalProperties: false,
+    required: ['windowId', 'x', 'y'],
+    properties: {
+      windowId: { type: 'integer', minimum: 1 },
+      x: { type: 'integer', minimum: -32768, maximum: 32768 },
+      y: { type: 'integer', minimum: -32768, maximum: 32768 },
+    },
+  },
+  'window:setTitle': {
+    type: 'object',
+    additionalProperties: false,
+    required: ['windowId', 'title'],
+    properties: {
+      windowId: { type: 'integer', minimum: 1 },
+      title: { type: 'string', minLength: 1, maxLength: 128 },
+    },
+  },
+};
+```
+
+```typescript
+const created = await window.chips.request<IWindowCreateOutput>('window:create', {
+  title: '图片处理',
+  width: 1024,
+  height: 720,
+});
+
+await window.chips.request<void>('window:resize', {
+  windowId: created.windowId,
+  width: 1280,
+  height: 800,
+});
+
+await window.chips.request<void>('window:move', { windowId: created.windowId, x: 120, y: 80 });
+
+await window.chips.request<void>('window:setTitle', {
+  windowId: created.windowId,
+  title: '图片处理 - 已保存',
+});
+
+const opened = await window.chips.request<IWindowListOutput>('window:list', {});
+void opened.windows;
+
+await window.chips.request<void>('window:setState', {
+  windowId: created.windowId,
+  state: 'maximized',
+});
+
+await window.chips.request<void>('window:focus', { windowId: created.windowId });
+await window.chips.request<void>('window:close', { windowId: created.windowId });
+```
+
+约束：`windowId` 为 Electron `webContents.id`；仅 `app` 角色可持有窗口类权限（第 6.3 节）。`window:list` 只返回调用方会话可访问的窗口，不暴露其他插件窗口。非自身窗口操作按 `window:control` 判定；自身窗口在免权限范围（[08-权限系统设计](../01-架构设计/01-子系统设计/08-权限系统设计.md) 第 4.4 节）。窗口创建失败返回 `WINDOW_NOT_FOUND` / `WINDOW_OPERATION_FAILED`。
+
+---
+
+**文档结束**

