+# 能力契约规范
+
+> 版本：v1.0.0
+> 日期：2026-09-19
+> 状态：正式版
+> 适用范围：薯片生态能力体系的契约权威：能力模型、命名规则、注册/发现/注销、JSON Schema 约定、权限映射、Bridge 内置能力逐项契约、内容处理服务能力登记、第三方能力注册规则、生命周期与版本、错误码。
+
+---
+
+### 7.7 对话框 `dialog:*`
+
+| 能力 ID | 输入要点 | 输出要点 |
+|---|---|---|
+| `dialog:open` | `title` 可选；`multiple` 默认 `false`；`directory` 默认 `false`；`filters` 可选 | `{ canceled, paths }`；取消时 `canceled: true`、`paths: []` |
+| `dialog:save` | `title` 可选；`defaultPath` 可选；`filters` 可选 | `{ canceled, path }`；取消时 `path: null` |
+
+```typescript
+interface IDialogFileFilter {
+  name: string;
+  extensions: string[];
+}
+
+interface IDialogOpenInput {
+  title?: string;
+  multiple?: boolean;
+  directory?: boolean;
+  filters?: IDialogFileFilter[];
+}
+
+interface IDialogOpenOutput {
+  canceled: boolean;
+  paths: string[];
+}
+
+interface IDialogSaveInput {
+  title?: string;
+  defaultPath?: string;
+  filters?: IDialogFileFilter[];
+}
+
+interface IDialogSaveOutput {
+  canceled: boolean;
+  path: string | null;
+
+}
+```
+
+```typescript
+const dialogInputSchemas: Readonly<Record<string, JSONSchema>> = {
+  'dialog:open': {
+    type: 'object',
+    additionalProperties: false,
+    properties: {
+      title: { type: 'string', maxLength: 128 },
+      multiple: { type: 'boolean', default: false },
+      directory: { type: 'boolean', default: false },
+      filters: {
+        type: 'array',
+        maxItems: 16,
+        items: {
+          type: 'object',
+          additionalProperties: false,
+          required: ['name', 'extensions'],
+          properties: {
+            name: { type: 'string', minLength: 1, maxLength: 64 },
+            extensions: {
+              type: 'array',
+              minItems: 1,
+              maxItems: 32,
+              items: { type: 'string', pattern: '^\\.[A-Za-z0-9]+$' },
+            },
+          },
+        },
+      },
+    },
+  },
+  'dialog:save': {
+    type: 'object',
+    additionalProperties: false,
+    properties: {
+
+      title: { type: 'string', maxLength: 128 },
+      defaultPath: { type: 'string', minLength: 1 },
+      filters: {
+        type: 'array',
+        maxItems: 16,
+        items: {
+          type: 'object',
+          additionalProperties: false,
+          required: ['name', 'extensions'],
+          properties: {
+            name: { type: 'string', minLength: 1, maxLength: 64 },
+            extensions: {
+              type: 'array',
+              minItems: 1,
+              maxItems: 32,
+              items: { type: 'string', pattern: '^\\.[A-Za-z0-9]+$' },
+            },
+          },
+        },
+      },
+    },
+  },
+};
+```
+
+```typescript
+const picked = await window.chips.request<IDialogOpenOutput>('dialog:open', {
+  title: '选择卡片文件',
+  multiple: false,
+  filters: [{ name: '薯片卡片', extensions: ['.card'] }],
+});
+
+if (!picked.canceled) {
+  const target = picked.paths.at(0);
+  if (target !== undefined) {
+    await window.chips.request<void>('file:read', { path: target, encoding: 'utf-8' });
+  }
+}
+```
+
+约束：对话框由平台渲染，插件无法伪造、预填或跳过；**用户选择不产生文件系统授权**，后续读写仍需 `filesystem:read` / `filesystem:write` 覆盖对应路径，否则返回 `BRIDGE_PERMISSION_DENIED`。用户取消不是错误。
+
+---
+
+**文档结束**

